1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,148
Reduction is easy.

2
00:00:02,148 --> 00:00:10,729
Nickel aluminium alloy in alkali, or zinc and hydrochloric acid, replaces chlorine by hydrogen to give benzene.

3
00:00:10,729 --> 00:00:18,359
It works where hydroxide fails because the hydrogen arrives as a neutral atom, not as a nucleophile.

